{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RoundUrbs is a minimalistic relaxing city builder game where you place variety of circular tiles connected to each other by roads to create unique city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6. Services</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose various environments to create you city:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Greenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Desert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/roundurbs-ss3.png?t=1746562866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Score Mode - Place tiles next to each other strategically in order to get maximum score and level up to get more tiles to place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Sandbox Mode - Place unlimited tiles freely as per your wish to create city of your dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/roundurbs-ss6.png?t=1746562866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback. Thank you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691180?t=1746562866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691180?t=1746562866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/3b15757497239a6a8a9c81b71ccf6f4beb572836/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746562866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/3b15757497239a6a8a9c81b71ccf6f4beb572836/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746562866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RoundUrbs is a minimalistic relaxing city builder game where you place variety of circular tiles connected to each other by roads to create unique city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6. Services</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can choose various environments to create you city:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Greenery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Desert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Cold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/roundurbs-ss3.png?t=1746562866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Score Mode - Place tiles next to each other strategically in order to get maximum score and level up to get more tiles to place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Sandbox Mode - Place unlimited tiles freely as per your wish to create city of your dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/extras/roundurbs-ss6.png?t=1746562866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please feel free to reach out to me for any feedback. Thank you!</p>","developers":["HidingDev Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691180/8cf3474887ed39145174a249f2c393b359b42a08/header.jpg?t=1746562866","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134962,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134962/movie480.mp4?t=1746562761","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134962/movie_max.mp4?t=1746562761"},"name":"Initial_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134962/6d0d027d1a726bbf24496dfe98c2e71f671f4642/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746562761","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134962/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746562761","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134962/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746562761"}}],"name":"RoundUrbs","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT550M | AMD Radeon R7/HD 5650 | Intel HD 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT740M | AMD Radeon R8 | Intel HD 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["HidingDev 